\id GAL  
\h Galetiya 
\toc3 Gal 
\toc1 Galetiya Tovetumagana Yadi Leta Paulo Givetokilumina 
\toc2 Galetiya 
\mt1 Galetiya Tovetumagana Yadi Leta Paulo Givetokilumina  
\is1 Kivemala  
\ip Kaliva-dina badi Yeisu imadu vetumaganena ani meIsileli gagana, badi tova tuwai-moena Yaubada giveledi yana veimeya-dina Mosese wagaine. Ada tovetumagana-dina nagona mulidiya, badi keke meIsileli kaduwe ivetumagana Yeisu wagaine, aku keke ida muliye Mosese yana veimeya. Aku meIsileli tovetumagana tufodi ani ivetumagana vaita Mosese yana veimeya ani kadu badi keke meIsileli ida muliyedi, e ada badi inunudadananau aku badi keke meIsileli tovetumagana ilulumodovedi ke Mosese yana veimeya ina muliyedi. Aku Paulo ani keke gida nuwanuwa anafaiweya, ada yana laumamala wagaine givonavona meGaletiya wagaidiya, givona, “Wai seya-moena wagaine Yaubada ginasemi yegayegamiyavo Tauna matane, taine yami vetumagana gagana Yeisu wagaine.”  
\ip E aku aimo Paulo gimiyamiya atuwada aku gikaiyanogala vaita tovewala fwayafwaya iyegemona Galetiya anafafaliya ada igaluvaluva tovetumagana ina nuvuyoyedi. Kaduwe badi tovewala-dina ivonavona vaita Paulo keke afositolo velemoena e ada kaliva keke bonana ida nogali. E ada leta taidei giimilina wagaidiya ke tovetumagana gina kivetunudi, ada giluwageyedi ke taide vewala fwayafwaya-nai ani ina segena. Ada leta anaebalauyabu wagaine Paulo givona kivetoyogidi ke yadi dewa ina itaveyabidi.  
\io1 Vona vesiule. \ior (1:1-5)\ior*  
\io1 Valeya iwakana seya-moena, keke tamo anavelu. \ior (1:6-10)\ior*  
\io1 Paulo anavedo Yaubada wagaine. \ior (1:11 - 2:10)\ior*  
\io1 Paulo Pita yana koyona faina givona tunutunugina wagaine. \ior (2:11-21)\ior*  
\io1 Mosese yana veimeya anamuliya o kai Keliso anavetumagana? \ior (3:1 - 4:31)\ior*  
\io1 Keliso gietoyavuda Mosese yana veimeya yana iyogona wagaine. \ior (5:1-26)\ior*  
\io1 Imi seyana seyana wana velemalema amivita wagaidiya. \ior (6:1-10)\ior*  
\io1 Paulo yana matawa anaebalauyabu ke vetalakafoi. \ior (6:11-18)\ior*  
\c 1  
\p
\v 1 Iya Paulo, Yeisu Keliso yana afositolo seyana. Keke kaliva-mowa ida venuwadadaneku ke gada veafositolo, keke-mowa. Aku Yeisu Keliso Tauna ke Yaubada Tamada Banae Yeisu gisiveyawana alikeya ani adiselu gaga ivenuwadadaneku ke gaveafositolo.  
\v 2 Imi Yaubada yana yoo wamiyamiya yana ekalesiya seyana seyana Galetiya anafafali wagaine ani Iyayeku ada tubuiyadeyavo idedeku nodi yama vesiule wagaimiya.  
\v 3 Yaubada Tamada ada yada Kauveya Yeisu Keliso yadi nuwadogeya ina lemelememi, ada kaduwe aseasemi ina kikiveniwalovidi.  
\v 4 Keliso Tauna givele-kavovoyena yada koyona faina, e ada gina etoyavuda malinai tova-dina adidewa koyodi wagaidiya.\x † \xo 1:4 \xt Tai 2:14\x* Taidei, yada Yaubada Banae Tamada yana nuwanuwa gimuliyena anafaiweya.  
\v 5 E ada Yaubada Banae anayegana kana kikilakaina tova moyaina keke anaebalauyabu. Ika anafaiweya.   
\s1 Valeya iwakana seya-moena, keke tamo anavelu.  
\p
\v 6 Iya gatataweyana yami dewa wagaine. Faina Yaubada givenuwadadanemi Keliso yana nuwadoga wagaine, aku bademowa wanuyabuyabuna ada wanau mali vewala wagaine.  
\v 7 Ada velemoena taidei keke valeya iwakana. Keke-mowa. Aku kaliva tufodi ani nuwami ikikivevoganina ke igaluvaluva Keliso anavaleya iwakana ina vetoviviyena.\x † \xo 1:7 \xt Gug 15:1,24\x*  
\v 8 Aku keke bonadi wana nogalidi. Wana itana, kai gaito gina ifuifufu wagaimiya Yeisu faine aku yana ifufu-nai gina vetoviviyena valeya iwakana tuwaina avelemi, aga analauboda gina alika-vagata eli wagaine. Ime idedeku ada gabama anaaneloseyavo kaduwe. Kai ime anafaiweya adadewa, aga amalauboda ada alika-vagata eli wagaine.  
\v 9 Bademowa avona anafaiweya ada kaduwe ganavona-vagila, imiyavo bademowa valeya iwakana wavaina, e aku kai gaito seyana mali valeya tulina gilulumamalena wagaimiya, aga banae analauboda gina alika-vagata eli wagaine.   
\p
\v 10 Gavaiyamu, taidei gavonavona, e ani ananogala vaita gagaluvaluva ke kaliva Iya ina awaveiwakaneku? Keke. Iya nuwanuwaku ani Yaubada yana awaveiwakana. O kai gagaluvaluva kaliva gakikivemwamwalidi?\x † \xo 1:10 \xt 1Tes 2:4\x* Kai aimo gagaluvaluva kaliva nuwadi gana vaina ke nuwanuwadi Iyayeku, aga Iya keke Keliso yana togugai.   
\s1 Paulo anavedo Yaubada wagaine.  
\p
\v 11 Tubuiyakuweyavo, nuwanuwaku imi wana alamanena, valeya iwakana galumamalena ani keke kaliva-mowa yadi nuwanuwa wagaine gidaela.\x † \xo 1:11 \xt Mad 16:17\x*  
\v 12 Faina Iya keke gadavai kaliva-mowa wagaidiya o kai seyana gaito gida vewala wagaikuya, aku Yeisu Keliso Banae giivemogatalina wagaikuya.   
\p
\v 13 Faina bademowa wanogalina tuwaina yawaiku anaifuifufu, tova-nai ime meIsileli yama vetumagana anagiduwa gamuliyedi. Ada Yaubada yana kalivayavo gakiveuloulolonidi ke gagaluvaluva evona yana ekalesiya gana luyavulena.\x † \xo 1:13 \xt Gug 8:3, 22:4-5, 26:9-11\x*  
\v 14 Ime meIsileli yama vetumagana anagiduwa wagaine, gaawaegeku velemoena ada wai ganago-moena gugai wagaine ayo muliya tubuiyakuweyavo, ada tamameyavo nagona adigiduwa faina ganuwanuwa toyogi-moena.\x † \xo 1:14 \xt Gug 22:3\x*  
\v 15 Aku yaku tubuga wagaine-deya\x † \xo 1:15 \xt Ais 49:1,5, Iyel 1:5, Luk 1:15\x* Yaubada givenuwadadane-vagaiku. Yana nuwadoga wagaine givenuwadadaneku yana togugai,\x † \xo 1:15 \xt Gug 9:3-6\x* ada wa yana vemwamwala  
\v 16 Natuna giivemogatalina wagaikuya\x † \xo 1:16 \xt Gug 9:3-6\x* e ada Banae gada lumamalena badi keke meIsileli wagaidiya. Tova-nai wagaine, keke seyana gaito gadavone ke gida voneku gavana gana gugai Banae faine,  
\v 17 o kai gadalaka Yelusalema gada itadi badi imaduveafositolo biyavo-dina. Aku ganau tunutunugina Alebiya anafafali wagaine, e ada muliya gayewaku Damasiko.   
\p
\v 18 Malamala toiye muline, galaka Yelusalema ke Pita gana madubodana, ada nodi amiya yadayada fifitini.\x † \xo 1:18 \xt Gug 9:26-30\x*  
\v 19 Wadedeku keke tamo gava afositolo gadaita aku Iyemesa anakaibe, banae yada Kauveya taina.\x † \xo 1:19 \xt Mad 13:55\x*  
\v 20 Yaubada gialamanena gavana gavetokilumina ani vona velemoena, keke gada vefwayafwaya.  
\v 21 Ada muliya ganau Siliya ke Silisiya.  
\v 22 Tova-nai wagaine Keliso anatovetumagana adiyoo tulina tulina Yudiya anafafali wagaine ani keke ida alamaneku.  
\v 23 Tainei-mowa ikaiyanogala taidei anafaiweya, “Kaliva-nai tuwaina ide gikiveuloulolonida, ani malinai gilulumamalena vetumagana-nai tuwaina gibalalava gida luveyawaliyena.”  
\v 24 E ada wagaikuya-deya Yaubada idavana. \fig Paulo valeya iwakana gilumamalena. (1:23)|alt="man preaching" src="cn01961B.tif" size="col" loc="1:20-24" copy="DCC" ref="1:23" \fig*   
\c 2  
\s1 Afositoloyavo Yelusalema wagaine iawaveiwakanena Paulo yana laumamala.  
\p
\v 1 Malamala fotini muline galaka-vagila Yelusalema wagaine Banabasi nodi, ada kaduwe Taito.  
\v 2 Ganau faina Yaubada giivemogatalina wagaikuya gadanau. E ada ganau badi gavega tonagonayavo Yelusalema wagaine nodi amaloi avagauta, ada gaawatalatalainedi valeya iwakana ifuifufuna galumamalena badi keke meIsileli wagaidiya. Badi tonagona gaga gaifuifufuyedi faina nuwanuwaku gavaiyamu gavevewala ani ina alamanena. Faina ganuwamatauta aenanai taidei yaku vewala-nai ina dibusoyogena, e ada yaku gugai tuwaina-deya gielai malinai ani ginaavai-kavovo-ku guwana keke.  
\v 3 Taito akutokwayabu, ani banae kwana Giliki aku auwe keke ida luyali ke vovona bubuna bwatana ida tomogoloi.\x † \xo 2:3 \xt Luk 1:59 ke anaailabama adiebakivemala\x*  
\v 4 Aku kaliva tufodi nuwanuwadi Taito tomogolota gina vaina, aku biyavo-dina tovetumagana fwayafwaya ani amayoo wagaine iluku ke ikavuya inaita venuvenuwadadanema gavaiyamu amaetoyavuga anuwagana Yeisu Keliso wagaine. Faina biyavo-dina nuwanuwadi ina yogoma Mosese yana veimeya ananuwanuwa wagaine, vaita togugai yogoyogodi anafaiweya.\f ** \fr 2:4 \ft Tova-nai wagaine kaliva tufodi aimo inuwanuwa vaita Mosese yana veimeya anamuliya wagaine adikibababala ina nuwagana. Aku Yeisu yana alika wagaine kaliva adikibababala ananuwaga ani Yeisu anavetumagana wagaine. Taidei adaiyavuga. \f*  
\v 5 Aku keke maita seyana ada awaega yadi nuwanuwa wagaine, e ada valeya iwakana anatunutunugina velemoena aimo gina miyamiya imi keke meIsileli wagaimiya.\x † \xo 2:5 \xt Gug 15:1,24\x*   
\p
\v 6 Ada Iya gaifufuyedi valeya-nai iwakana galulumamalena kaliva wagaidiya faine, ada badi gavega adiyegana lakaidi au iawaegau wagaine. Tova-nai inogalina, keke idavona venuwadadane, ada keke gavavona ida vetutamwata yaku laumamala wagaine. Aku kai tamo kaliva wa anayegana o kai keke, wada keke gaitoma lakaina wagaikuya. Yaubada matane kaliva matatabuna ani leleleya.\x † \xo 2:6 \xt Gug 10:34\x*  
\v 7 Badi tonagonayavo keke mali veimeya ida veleku, aku iinanana vaita Pita veimeya Yaubada givelena ke ginanau valeya iwakana gina lumamalena badi meIsileli\f ** \fr 2:7 \ft Badi meIsileli ani Yaubada tomogolota anagiduwa giveledi e ada tuwaina-deya imulimuliyena, aku badi keke meIsileli ani keke ida muliye. Aku giduwa-nai ani gaitoma lakaina meIsileli wagaidiya, ada taide faina Paulo yana vetokilumina vona Giliki wagaine ani meIsileli givewagadi ‘badi vovo anatomogolota ivaina’ aku badi keke meIsileli givewagadi ‘badi aditomogolota keke’.\f* wagaidiya anafaiweya, Iya kaduwe veimeya giveleku ke givetumaganeku valeya iwakana gana lumamalena badi keke meIsileli wagaidiya, badi tomogolota anagiduwa keke ida muliye.  
\v 8 Faina Yaubada Banae Pita gitoyogivelena ke giveafositolo meIsileli wagaidiya, ani kaduwe Iya gitoyogiveleku ke gaveafositolo badi keke meIsileli wagaidiya.  
\v 9 Iyemesa, Pita, ada Iyoni, badi ivetonagona kaliva matadiya, ani iitainana Yaubada yana nuwadogeya faisewa taidei lakaina giveleku, e ada Banabasi ke Iyayeku ivenimasibutuyema, ada tayuwe giveiyaiyaya vaita ime aveyavo seyana gugai taidei wagaine. Ada iawaegau Banabasi ada Iyayeku ana faisewa badi keke meIsileli adimwatuguya aku badiyavo ani meIsileli adimwatuguya.  
\v 10 Aku yadi veola seya-moena ani fanifanidiyavo ada nuwaudududi badi yadi yoo wagaine, gaitoma-nai nuwanuwaku lakaina gana faisewana.\x † \xo 2:10 \xt Gug 11:29-30\x*   
\s1 Paulo Pita yana koyona faina givona tunutunugina wagaine.  
\p
\v 11 Aku tova-nai Pita gielai Anitiyoki melala wagaine ani gaitana yana gugai seyana ani koyona velemoena, e ada bana wagaine gavona tunutunugina yoo matadiya.  
\v 12 Faina tova nagona wagaidiya ani tova moyaina Pita gikanikani tovetumagana badi keke meIsileli nodi. Aku muliya kaliva tufodi ielai Iyemesa wagaine Yelusalema-deya, ani giitadi e ada badi keke meIsileli gimiyasegedi ada keke nodi ida kanikani. Faina meIsileli badi inuwanuwa toyogina Mosese yana veimeya wagaine ke tomogolota anaveimeya faina ani yoo-dina gimatausedi.  
\v 13 Ada kaduwe meIsileli tovetumagana Anitiyoki wagaine ani Pita yana meyalagalaga imuliyena. Ada keke badiyavo gaga aku kadu Banabasi nodi yadi meyalagalaga wagaine nuwadi isebalena.   
\s1 Yada vetumagana wagaine Yaubada giseda yegayegadeyavo Tauna matane.  
\p
\v 14 Aku tova-nai gaitana yadi dewa keke anafaiweya valeya iwakana ananuwanuwa velemoena, e ada Pita gavonena tovetumagana moyaidi matadiya, gavonaga, “Oyeni kwana Isileli. Aku ya dewa anafaiweya badi keke meIsileli yadi dewa, ada keke meIsileli anafaiweya. E aku gavaiyamu-yo badi keke meIsileli ululuyalidi e ada meIsileli adagiduwa ina muliye? Taidei dewa keke iwakana wagaikuya.”  
\v 15 Ideyavo katubuga meIsileli. Ide keke badi keke meIsileli, badi kavewagadi ‘tokoyona’.\f ** \fr 2:15 \ft MeIsileli ani Yaubada giveledi yana veimeya Mosese wagaine, ada taidei faina badiyavo inuwanuwa vaita taudiyavo yegayegadiyavo. Aku badi keke meIsileli ani Mosese yana veimeya keke wagaidiya gida miyami e ada keke ida mulimuliye. Taidei faina meIsileli inuwenuwedi vaita badi tokoyona.\f*  
\v 16 E aku kaalamanena kai kaliva Mosese yana veimeya gina matawalewaleyena vaita taidei wagaine Yaubada ginasena yegayegana Tauna matane, aga taidei gina galuvaluva-wayoga. Faina Yeisu Keliso wagaine ani taidei wai-nai gaga wagaine Yaubada kaliva ginasena yegayegana Tauna matane. Taidei faina ide meIsileli kaduwe Yeisu Keliso wagaine kavetumagana e ada yada yegayegana kanuwagana yada vetumagana Banae wagaine. Keke vaita Mosese yana veimeya anamatawalewale wagaine aimo kada tunutunuvala ke yada yegayegana kanavai. Faina veimeya-nai anamatawalewale ani keke anafata bana wagaine ada seyana gaito Yaubada ginasena yegayegana Tauna matane.\x † \xo 2:16 \xt Lom 3:20-28, 11:6\x*   
\p
\v 17 Aku kai yada yegayegana kalelelena Keliso wagaine aku wadedeku-deya kana itanuwagada vaita ide tokoyona, aga gavaiyamu, evona Keliso Banae ani koyona anatovegugai e ada ginagoyeda ke kakoyokoyona? Au keke-mowa.  
\v 18 Ada kai Iya kaduwe gada vetumagana vaita Mosese yana veimeya gaidibumwaigena faina, Yaubada ginaseku yegayegaku Banae matane, aga Iya anafaiweya kaliva bana manuwa giyawelina aku gaitoma-dina manuwa wagaine iyogona ani givaidi ada wagaidiya manuwa kaduwe giyogona. Tova maufona ani gina malina vaita veimeya-dina seyadi Yaubada Mosese givelena ani Iya aditoiyawela.  
\v 19 Mosese yana veimeya-nai anaidibumwaiga ani Iya keke akufaiweya, e aku akuetoyavuga ganuwagana veimeya-nai wagaine e ada akufaiweya yawaiku gana miyamiyanena Yaubada faine.  
\v 20 Tova-nai Keliso ikivebolagalagana, Iya yaku dewa koyona nodi ikivebolagalagana. Ada yawai-nai wagaikuya malinai ani Keliso yawaina, keke tauku yawaiku. Yawai-nai vovoku wagaine gamiyamiyanena ani Yaubada Natuna anavetumagana wagaine, Banae ginuwakabubuyeku ada yawaina giawaegena faikuya.\x † \xo 2:20 \xt Lom 6:6, 7:6, Iyo 13:1, Gal 1:4\x*  
\v 21 Yaubada yana nuwadogeya gilemeku lakai-moena, ada taidei nuwadoga-nai keke gada vegaitoma-kavokavovoye. Faina kai anafata kaliva yana yegayegana ginuwagana veimeya anaitaveyabina wagaine, aga Keliso gialika-kavovo faideya.   
\c 3  
\s1 Mosese yana veimeya anamuliya o kai Keliso anavetumagana?  
\p
\v 1 Imi meGaletiya kwavakwavamiyavo! Gaito yami nuwanuwa gikivekoyo ke gikivebalami yana nuwanuwa koyona wagaine? Tuwaina akivemalina wagaimiya Yeisu Keliso yana alika kelose wagaine, anafaiweya vaita matamiya taumiyavo wadaita.  
\v 2 Nuwanuwaku gaitoma seya-moena faina gana tolidadana wagaimiya. Aluwaluwa Tabuna Banae gimiyamiya nafomiya ani gavawai wagaine wavai? Veimeya anamatawalewale wagaine, o kai valeya iwakana wanogalina ada wavetumaganena faina?  
\v 3 Wavekwavakwava velemoena! Nago-moena wavevuvu yawai evaguna Aluwaluwa Tabuna yana toyogina wagaine, ani gavaiyamu-yo wagaluvaluva wana luyabu taumiyavo yami nuwanuwa gagana wagaine?  
\v 4 Gavaiyamu, gaitoma moyaidi walutovoni-kavovodi o kai keke? Keke.  
\v 5 Yaubada givelemi Aluwaluwana ke gugai ebameyasidobodobo gigugaiyedi amimwatuguya, gavana vuvuna? Yami matawalewale Mosese yana veimeya wagaine, o kai valeya iwakana wanogalina ada wavetumaganena faina? Au yami vetumagana faina.   
\p
\v 6 Wanaduna Ebelaamo. Buki Tabu givona,  
\b  
\q2 “Banae Yaubada givetumaganena ada yana  
\q2 vetumagana faina, Yaubada giawaveiwakanena  
\q2 ke givona banae faine, givona, ‘Banae yegayegana  
\q2 Iya matakuya.’” \x † \xo 3:6 \xt Eba 15:6, Lom 4:3,9,22, Iyem 2:23\x*   
\b  
\m
\v 7 Taidei faina nuwami gina malina vaita badi gavega ivetumagana ani biyavo-dina velemoena Ebelaamo natunavo.\f ** \fr 3:7 \ft Ebelaamo ani badi meIsileli tamadi nagona. Aku ide taudeyavo kaawaegeda Yeisu wagaine ani yada vetumagana wagaine ide kaduwe Ebelaamo yana tubudelideli, e ada gikivelaubodana ke banae kaduwe ide tamada nagona. (Lom 4:16)\f*  
\v 8 Buki Tabu wagaine gimaduvonayena ani yadi vetumagana faina, Yaubada badi keke meIsileli ginasedi yegayegadiyavo Banae matane. E ada Valeya Iwakana taidei ani Ebelaamo wagaine gimaduawatalatalainena, givonaga,  
\b  
\q2 “Oye wagainiya babi anakaliva adiyoo moyaidi ani  
\q2 ina vemwamwala, faina Yaubada yana nuwakabubu  
\q2 ke yana leme ina nuwagana.” \x † \xo 3:8 \xt Eba 12:3, 18:18, 22:18, Gug 3:25 \x*   
\b  
\m
\v 9 Ebelaamo ani tovetumagana velemoena, ada Yaubada wa yana nuwadoga gilemelemena. Ada kadu anafaiweya, badi gavega Yaubada ivetumaganena ani Banae wa yana nuwadoga gilemelemedi.\x † \xo 3:9 \xt Lom 4:16\x*   
\p
\v 10 Faina gavega moyaidi inuwaveyalaina vaita Mosese yana veimeya gaga ina matawalewaleyena ke yadi yegayegana ina nuwagana Yaubada matane, ani badiyavo alatabutabu dibune imiyamiya. Faina Buki Tabu wagaine givona,  
\b  
\q2 “Gavega keke ina gugugaiye gavana matatabuna  
\q2 Veimeya anabuki wagaine giveimeya,  
\q2 aga alatabutabu dibune imiyamiya.” \x † \xo 3:10 \xt 2Vei 27:26\x*   
\b  
\m
\v 11 E ada gimalina ani veimeya anamuliya wagaine Yaubada keke seyana gaito gida awaveiwakane ke gidasei yegayegana Banae matane. Faina Buki Tabu givona,  
\b  
\q2 “Badi gavega yegayegadiyavo Yaubada matane  
\q2 ani yadi vetumagana wagaine ina miyamiya.” \x † \xo 3:11 \xt Lom 1:17, Gal 2:16, Ibel 10:38\x*   
\b  
\m
\v 12 Aku veimeya anamatawalewale anawai ani tuli-moena Yaubada anavetumagana wagaine. Faina veimeya anamatawalewale anawai faine Buki Tabu wagaine givona,  
\b  
\q2 “Kai badi nuwanuwadi yawai ina nuwagana veimeya anamuliya wagaine,  
\q2 aga veimeya matatabu-moena ida matawalewaleyena.”\x † \xo 3:12 \xt Lom 10:5\x*   
\b  
\m
\v 13 Keliso gitutuveobuda veimeya yana alatabutabu wagaine-deya, faina ide faideya alatabutabu ginuwagana. Faina Buki Tabu givona,  
\b  
\q2 “Gavakaliva vovona kai ina luvekwaiyoyona ai wagaine,  
\q2 banae alatabutabu dibune gimiyamiya.”\x † \xo 3:13 \xt 2Vei 21:22-23, 2Kol 5:21\x*   
\b  
\m
\v 14 Taidei anafaiweya Yeisu Keliso keloseya gitutuveobuda e ada Banae wagaine awanuwakabubu-nai Yaubada givelena Ebelaamo ani gida yegemona badi keke meIsileli wagaidiya. E ada ide moyaida yada vetumagana wagaine kana nuwagana Aluwaluwa Tabuna Yaubada gimadu vonadabadabayena.   
\s1 Mosese yana veimeya ada Yaubada yana vonadabadaba.  
\p
\v 15 Tubuiyakuweyavo, nuwanuwaku gana vonaluvefosau kaliva yada dewa seyana wagaine. Kai kaliva adiselu ina awaegau gaitoma seyana faina ke ina vonadabadaba faine, ada fefe wagaine ina vetokilumina e ada gina toyoga, aga aimo keke meyameyaganina seyana gaito nuwanuwa-nai gina vaiyavule o kai nuwanuwa evaguna gina vetutamwata. Tainei kaliva-mowa yana vonadabadaba.  
\v 16 Aku kana nuwanuwayena vonadabadaba-dina Yaubada giveledi Ebelaamo ke yana tubudelideli wagaine. Buki Tabu wagaine Yaubada keke gidavona ‘yana tubudelideliyavo faidiya’ vaita moyaidi, aku givona ‘yana tubudelideli’ kaliva seyana faine, kaliva-nai Banae Keliso.\f ** \fr 3:16 \ft MeIsileli yadi vona wagaine keke idavona ‘tubudelideli’ vaita moyaidi. Ivona, ‘guwa’, ada taidei wagaine Yaubada giifufu kaliva seyana faine, ani Keliso. (Eba 12:7, 13:15, 24:7) \f*  
\v 17 Yaku vona anaalamana taidei anafaiweya. Nago-moena Yaubada yana veyavo anawai gibubuna Ebelaamo wagaine ada givonadabadaba-vagata wagaine, aku malamala fowa analedi teti (430) muline, Mosese yana veimeya giyegemona. Keke anafata Mosese yana veimeya muliya gielai ani Yaubada yana veyavo anawai gina luyaweli kai yana vonadabadaba gina vaiyavule.  
\v 18 Faina kai veimeya anamatawalewale wagaine Yaubada adavutuga gina veleda, aga keke gidaela Yaubada yana vonadabadaba wagaine. Tainei keke anafaiweya. Aku anavelemoena ani Yaubada yana nuwadogeya anavutuga givelena Ebelaamo yana vonadabadaba wagaine.\x † \xo 3:18 \xt Lom 4:13-14, 11:6, Ibel 6:13-14\x*   
\p
\v 19 Aku gavaiyamu-yo nagona Yaubada yana vonadabadaba giveleda aku muliya veimeya giveleda? Yaubada veimeya giveleda e ada kaliva ina inanana vaita veimeya-nai iyaweyawelina, faina yadi nuwanuwa koyodi.\x † \xo 3:19 \xt Lom 5:20\x* Ada veimeya-nai gimiya-deya Ebelaamo yana tubudelideli velemoena gielai, Banae Yaubada givonadabadabayena. Ada kaduwe, veimeya giveledi anelose wagaidiya ada tomidigolota-nai Mosese badi ivelena, ada banae giveledi kaliva.  
\v 20 Tomidigolota gilubodana yoo iluwei faidiya, aku tova-nai Yaubada yana vonadabadaba givelena Ebelaamo, Yaubada anakaibe-mowa gigugaiyena.   
\p
\v 21 Seyana gaito kai gina tolidadana, “Gavaiyamu, kai Yaubada yana veimeya vaita givenibainena Yaubada yana vonadabadaba o keke?” Au keke, keke-mowa! Faina kai veimeya gida veleda ani anafata yawaida evaguna gina veleda, aga yegayegana Yaubada matane kada nuwagana veimeya-nai anamatawalewale wagaine.\x † \xo 3:21 \xt Lom 8:2-4\x*  
\v 22 Aku ida keke anafaiweya. Faina Yaubada yana vona givona matatabu-moeda ani anafaiweya kaliva badi imiyamiya koyona anadeli wagaine. Faina koyona gikikiveyabida. Tainei faine gisebodada, keke tamo gavawai kanavai.\x † \xo 3:22 \xt Lom 3:9-20\x* Aku tainei wagaine ide kana vetumagana Yeisu Keliso wagaine, ada yada vetumagana wagaine gavana Yaubada tuwaina givonadabadabayena ani guwana kana vaina.   
\p
\v 23 Aku muliya-yo vetumagana taidei gielai, ideyavo ani veimeya giyogoda ke kavetogugai wagaine analaba Yaubada vetumagana anawai gikiveyegemonina.  
\v 24 E, ada Mosese yana veimeya ani anafaiweya adatoitaveyabina. Ginagoyeda analaba Keliso giobuelai ke yada vetumagana wagaine Yaubada gidaseda yegayegadeyavo Tauna matane.  
\v 25 Aku malinai ani vetumagana anawai bademowa giyegemona, ada ideyavo tova malinai keke-mowa aimo kada miyami veimeya yana itaveyabina dibune.  
\v 26 Faina moyaimi ani imi Yaubada natunavo yami vetumagana Keliso Yeisu wagaine.\x † \xo 3:26 \xt Iyo 1:12, Lom 8:14-16\x*  
\v 27 Faina imiyavo gavega wababitaiso Keliso anayeganeya ani bademowa Banae nodi waveseyana ada Keliso wavaina waosena anafaiweya nuya.\x † \xo 3:27 \xt Lom 6:3-4\x*  
\v 28 Ada Keliso wagaine keke tamo anatulina imi meIsileli o kai imi keke meIsileli, ada keke anatulina imi togugai yogoyogomi o kai kaliva keke yogoyogomiyavo, kai kaliva o kai vevine. Faina imi matatabumiyavo anafaiweya seya-moena Keliso wagaine.\x † \xo 3:28 \xt Lom 3:30, 1Kol 12:12-14\x*  
\v 29 Ada kai imi Keliso yana kalivayavo, aga imiyavo Ebelaamo yana tubudelideliyavo, ada amivutuvutuga-nai faine tuwai-moena Yaubada givonadabadaba ani imi anatoinavuvuna.\x † \xo 3:29 \xt Gal 4:1,7, Lom 4:13, 8:17, Efes 3:6\x*   
\c 4  
\p
\v 1 Aku yaku vona ani taidei anafaiweya ananuwanuwa. Kaliva natuna aimo tauna tamana yana ebaveimeya matatabuna gina vaina tova-nai kwamana-nai gina veasekumaga. Aku faina aimo yana tova kwamana ani anaivi anaita anafaiweya togugai yogoyogona.  
\v 2 Anatoitaveyabina yadi veimeya dibune gina miyamiya ada yana giba-dina ina itaveyabidi ginanau analaba anamalamala gina nuwagana, anafaiweya tamana givenuwadadanena.  
\v 3 E ada muliya-yo Keliso gielai, ideyavo anafaiweya biyabiyama, ada babi anaaluwaluwayavo yadi veimeya kamulimuliyedi vaita ide yadi togugai yogoyogodiyavo.  
\v 4 Aku tova-nai anatova velemoena Yaubada givenuwadadanena giyegemona, Natuna giimili gielai, ada vavine-mowa wagaine gitubuga ada gimiya Mosese yana veimeya dibune.\x † \xo 4:4 \xt Iyo 1:14, Lom 8:3-4\x*  
\v 5 Taidei anafaiweya giyegemona e ada ide kamiya veimeya-nai dibune ani gina tutuveobuda, ke taidei wagaine ide Yaubada natunavo kana miyamiya.  
\v 6 Ada imiyavo Yaubada natunavo faina, Natuna Aluwaluwana giimilina ke giluku aseasemiya, ada Aluwaluwana Banae givedovedou Yaubada wagaine, “Kamaku! Kamaku-yo!” \x † \xo 4:6 \xt Lom 8:15-17\x*  
\v 7 Taidei faina, imiyavo keke-mowa aimo togugai yogoyogona anafaiweya, aku imi Yaubada natunavo. Ada imi natunavo faina, kaduwe gavana iwakana gikidewedewena ani wana nuwagana, faina imiyavo toinavuvuna.\x † \xo 4:7 \xt Gal 3:29, Lom 8:17\x*   
\s1 Paulo nuwana givenauna meGaletiya faidiya.  
\p
\v 8 Tova nagona wagaine tova-nai Yaubada keke wada alamane, wavetogugai yogoyogona badiyavo yaubada fwayafwaya wagaidiya.  
\v 9 Aku tova malinai Yaubada velemoena waalamanena, o kai gana vonaga Yaubada ani velemoena imi gialamanemi. E ada gavaiyamu-yo wayewayewa-vagila babi anaaluwaluwayavo kabekabebedi ke fanifanidiyavo wana muliyedi? Gavaiyamu, nuwanuwami wana vetogugai yogoyogona kaduwe wagaidiya?  
\v 10 Imi keke meIsileli aku meIsileli yadi tafalolo anayadayada lakaidi waitaitaveyabidi, kaduwe vaikoi evaguna adiveimeya ke abutu tulidi tulidi adiveimeya ada malamala evaguna adiveimeya.\f ** \fr 4:10 \ft Dewa-nai wagaine inuwanuwa vaita yegayegana ina nuwagana Yaubada matane, aku keke. \f*  
\v 11 E ada gavenuwana lakaina faimiya, aenanai yaku faisewa wagaimiya gina vegaitoma-kavokavovo.   
\p
\v 12 Tubuiyakuweyavo, wagaimiya gaveoveola toyogina, imiyavo nagona yavuyavumiyavo Mosese yana veimeya anamuliya wagaine wamiyamiya, ani Iya malinai anafaiweya. Tuwaina keke aimo yogoyogoku veimeya-nai wagaine. Ada imi gilubodami yami nuwanuwa wada sevedavedamadi ke yaku dewa wada dewayena. Keke tamo koyona wadagai wagaikuya.  
\v 13 Waalamanena nagona gamaduelai gaveoga faina, ada tova-nai wagaine valeya iwakana galumamalena wagaimiya.  
\v 14 Ada yaku veoga faina vita gavelemi, aku auwe keke wada voyouyouyeku kadu keke wada vegaitoma-kavokavovoyeku. Aku wadeweku anafaiweya vaita Yaubada yana anelose seyana, o vaita Iya Yeisu Keliso Tauna.  
\v 15 Tova-nai wagaine wavemwamwala lakaina, e aku malinai vemwamwala-nai gadedeku gina? Gavonavona velemoena wagaimiya, tova nagona kai amifaiweya aga, matafoumi wada etomwamwali wada veleku.  
\v 16 E aku malinai ani gavaiyamu, Iya vona velemoena wagaimiya gaifufuyena faina, malinai waitaitaku vaita amigaviya anafaiweya?   
\p
\v 17 Biyavo-dina faidiya galuluwageyemi ani ibalabalalava e ada yami nuwanuwa toyogina wanasena wagaidiya, aku yadi nuwanuwa vuvuna keke iwakana. Nuwanuwadi ina ludakami wagaimeya e ada badiyavo gaga wa yami aseawaega nodi wana vemoimoinedi.  
\v 18 Kai gaito seyana nuwanuwana lakaina gaitoma iwakadi gina gugaiyedi faimiya, taidei iwakana. Aku gilubodana anafaiweya tova moyaina ida gugai, kai Iya nodi kamiyamiya o kai keke.  
\v 19 Natukuweyavo, malinai imi faimiya kaduwe gauloulolo, vaita vevine yadi venatuna anauloulolo anafaiweya ilutovonina. Ada aimo gana uloulolo anafaiweya analaba yami vetumagana ginatabo ginalaka ada Keliso yana dewa gina toyogina yami nuwanuwa wagaine.  
\v 20 Iya nuwanuwaku lakaina tova malinai imi nodi kada miyamiya e ada Iya gada ifufu bikana imi nodi. Aku gavaiyamu malinai gana ifufu wagaimiya? Gavenuwana lakaina imi faimiya.   
\s1 Veimeya anawai ada vetumagana anawai faidiya ani Ega ada Sela yada ebaita.  
\p
\v 21 Ada wana voneku. Imi gavega nuwanuwami Mosese yana veimeya dibune wanamiya ani gavaiyamu, maita waalamanena gavana veimeya-nai givona o kai keke?  
\v 22 Faina Veimeya anabuki wagaine givona ani Ebelaamo natunavo adiselu. Seyana, Ebelaamo yana togugai yogoyogodi Ega wagaidiya gitubuga.\f ** \fr 4:22 \ft Ebelaamo yana yoo tayuwe yadi dewa taidei anafaiweya. Vavine lakaina kai kakalina ani tamo tova yana togugai vavine gina awaegena moganena wagaine. Taidei wai-nai wagaine vavine-nai kakalina banae yana tubudelideli gina kiveinalina. Togugai-nai natudiyavo ina venatunedi ani keke tauna natunavo aku vavine kakalina natunavo. (Eba 16:1-15) \f* Aku seyana, banae tauna vavinena Sela badi keke togugai yogoyogodi wagaidiya gitubuga.\x † \xo 4:22 \xt Eba 21:1-7\x*  
\v 23 Ada natuna gitubuga badi vavine togugai yogoyogodi wagaidiya ani ideyavo kaliva-mowa yada tubugeya anafaiweya giyegemona.\x † \xo 4:23 \xt Lom 9:7-9\x* Aku banae gitubuga badi vavine keke togugai yogoyogodi wagaidiya, ani banae yana tubuga vuvuna Yaubada yana vonadabadaba wagaine.\x † \xo 4:23 \xt Eba 17:16-19, 18:10,14, 21:1-2, Ibel 11:11\x*  
\v 24 Ifufu taidei anunu anaifufu. Vevine adiselu ebaita seyana Yaubada yana veyavo anawai iluwei faidiya. Veyavo anawai nagona ani Yaubada Oya Sainai wagaine giyegemonena, tainei yana veimeya anawai. Ada wai-nai taidei ani badiyavo togugai yogoyogodi gikikiveyegemonidi. Ada Ega ebavonaluvefosa wai-nai faine.  
\v 25 Vavine-dina Ega ani badi anafaiweya ebavonaluvefosa Oya Sainai gimiyamiya Alebiya anafafali wagaine. Ada kaduwe vavine-dina ebavonaluvefosa tova malinai melala Yelusalema faina. Melala-nai anakalivamomo nodi ivetogugai yogoyogona Mosese yana veimeya dibune.\x † \xo 4:25 \xt Lom 8:15, Ibel 12:18-21\x*  
\v 26 Aku Sela, badi Ebelaamo vavinena velemoena ani anafaiweya gabama anaYelusalema getane-deya. Vavine-dina ani keke togugai yogoyogodi, ada badiye ani ide tovetumagana inada.\f ** \fr 4:26 \ft Vona taidei ananuwanuwa ani taide anafaiweya. Badi gavega keke ida luveyabina Mosese yana veimeya anamuliya aku ivetumagana Yeisu Keliso wagaine ada Banae gagana yana faisewa wagaine iluveyabina, biyavo-dina ani badi Yelusalema getane natunavo. Yelusalema getane ani tainei melala gabameya. (Ibel 12:22, Ive 3:12, 21:2,10)\f*  
\v 27 Taidei nuwanuwa-nai Aiseya giifufuyena tova-nai gifalofisai, givonaga,  
\b  
\q2 “Oye vavine kakali, oye keke uda venavenatuna  
\q2 ani una vemwamwala.  
\q2 Oye venatuna anaulolo keke uda lutovoni  
\q2 ani unakova vemwamwala,  
\q2 faina o mogane ginuyabuyabuni ani  
\q2 aimo-yo natumomo moyaidi una nuwagadi.  
\q2 E ada badi vavine wa moganedi ani  
\q2 natudiyavo maita moyaidi aku  
\q2 imi natumiyavo ani aimo moyai-moedi.” \x † \xo 4:27 \xt Ais 54:1\x*  
\b  
\m Taidei anafaiweya Aiseya givona.   
\m
\v 28 Aku tubuiyakuweyavo, imiyavo ani Yaubada natunavo yana vonadabadaba wagaine, anafaiweya Aisake.  
\v 29 Aku tova tayuwe wagaine natuna-nai gitubuga kaliva-mowa yada tubugeya, ani gikiveulolonina banae kwamana-nai gitubuga Aluwaluwa Tabuna yana toyogineya. Ada malinai anafaiweya. Badi gavega Mosese yana veimeya anamuliya wagaine iluluveyabina ani badi kivekoyo ifaifaisewana badi gavega Keliso wagaine iluluveyabina wagaidiya.  
\v 30 Aku Buki Tabu gavaiyamu givona? Givona,  
\b  
\q2 “Taidei togugai yogoyogodi vavine wa natudi  
\q2 una wavidi inanau.  
\q2 Faina vavine keke togugai yogoyogodi natudi  
\q2 anakaibe tamana laovina gina vaina, aku  
\q2 keke-mowa vavine togugai yogoyogodi natudi.” \x † \xo 4:30 \xt Eba 21:10, Iyo 8:35\x*   
\b  
\m
\v 31 E ada tubuiyakuweyavo, ideyavo keke vavine togugai yogoyogona natudiyavo, aku velemoena badi inada ani vavine-dina keke togugai yogoyogodi.   
\c 5  
\s1 Keliso gietoyavuda Mosese yana veimeya yana iyogona wagaine.  
\p
\v 1 Keliso gietoyavuda Mosese yana veimeya wagaine-deya,\x † \xo 5:1 \xt Iyo 8:32,36\x* e ada ideyavo ani keke aimo veimeya-nai yana togugai yogoyogodeyavo. Taidei faina gilubodana kana mididi toyogina. Keke taudeyavo kana kivevitada ke kanaseda kaduwe veimeya-nai dibune ginayogo-vagileda.\x † \xo 5:1 \xt Gug 15:10\x*  
\v 2 Wana nogalina. Iya Paulo gana vonemi, kai biyavo-dina bonadi wana abina ke wana awaegemi vovomi bubuna bwatana ina tomogoloina, aga Keliso yana awaega faideya ani keke maita gina lememi.  
\v 3 Kaduwe gana luvagilena moyaimi wagaimiya. Imi gavega tomogolota anagiduwa wagaine wana awaegemi ke Mosese yana veimeya wana mulimuliyedi, aga gilubodami yana veimeya matatabu-moena wana muliyena.  
\v 4 Imiyavo gavega wagaluvaluva ke Mosese yana veimeya anamuliya wagaine yami yegayegana Yaubada matane wana nuwagana ani velemoena taumiyavo waluludakami Keliso wagaine-deya, ada Yaubada yana nuwadoga wavedomobubusena.  
\v 5 Aku ideyavo ani kavetumagana. Ada Aluwaluwa Tabuna yana lemeya kaveitabodaboda Yaubada ginaseda yegayegadeyavo Tauna matane.  
\v 6 Faina ide Yeisu Keliso nodi kaveseyana ani kai vovo anatomogolota kavaina o kai keke, aga keke tamo gavana.\x † \xo 5:6 \xt Kol 3:11\x* Aku tainei-mowa gaitoma velemoena lakaina ani yada vetumagana-nai giveveguwa, e ada wa yada nuwakabubu nodi kaliva faidiya kanuwanuwa ke kalemelemedi.   
\p
\v 7 Tova nagona wa yami vetumagana wamadumaduga iwakana Keliso yana wai wagaine. Gaito yami nuwanuwa gisibale ke vona velemoena anamuliya wailova?  
\v 8 Nuwanuwa tainei wamuliyena ani keke gidaela Banae Yaubada gidouwemi wagaine.  
\v 9 E ada wana nuwaududuna vaita taide vewala fwayafwaya-nai kaliva toiye-mowa ivevewala ani matatabumi gina vaimi, anafaiweya yada vona seyana givona, “Falawa anayisti ani gaitoma kabisona, aku falawa negenine gina lukunau ke matatabuna gina lutuga.”\x † \xo 5:9 \xt 1Kol 5:6, 15:33, Ibel 12:15\x*  
\v 10 Aku Kauveya gavetumaganena gina lememi e ada keke mali nuwanuwa wana vaivaidi wagaidiya wana mididi. Ada gavakaliva banae yami nuwanuwa gisidakadakana, banae anamatavuloga gina nuwagana.   
\p
\v 11 Tubuiyakuweyavo, kaliva tufodi ivona vaita Iya galumamala vovo anatomogolota analauboda kibababala faina. Aku keke. Kai anafaiweya, keke aimo ida kiveulouloloniku. Ada kai gada lumamala anafaiweya, aga yadi agouga Keliso yana alika keloseya faina gida avaina.  
\v 12 Aku nuwanuwaku biyavo-dina nuwanuwa anatosidakadaka ilulumodovemi vovodi anatomogolota faina ani inanau-mowa ada taudiyavo vovodi ina lugoloidi, e ada lulugoloidiyavo!   
\p
\v 13 Tubuiyakuweyavo, Yaubada keke nuwanuwana aimo wana vetogugai yogoyogona Mosese yana veimeya anamuliya wagaine, aku nuwanuwana yavuyavugimiyavo wana miyamiya.\x † \xo 5:13 \xt 1Pi 2:16, Iyud 4, 1Kol 8:9, 2Pi 2:19\x* Taidei miya-nai faine givenuwadadanemi. Aku keke amiiyavuga-nai wagaine seba wanasei ke vovo ananuwanuwa faina wana gugai-kavokavovo, aku wa yami nuwakabubu imi seyana seyana wana velemalema.  
\v 14 Faina Mosese yana veimeya matatabuna giitavana veimeya seya-moena\x † \xo 5:14 \xt Mad 7:12, 22:40\x* wagaine, tainei, “Kaliva una nuwakabubuyedi o tauni unuwakabubuyeni anafaiweya.” \x † \xo 5:14 \xt Vei 19:18, Mad 5:43,44, Luk 10:27, Iyem 2:8\x*  
\v 15 Aku kai nuwanuwa koyodi wagaidiya tova moyaina taumiyavo wana veiyovayovaga ke wana vekanikani, wana itaveyabimi aenanai taumiyavo aimo wana luyaweyawelimi.   
\s1 Aluwaluwa Tabuna yana toyogina wagaine kana miyamiya.  
\p
\v 16 Taidei faina gana vonemi, Aluwaluwa Tabuna bonana wana abiabina\x † \xo 5:16 \xt Lom 8:3-4, 13:14\x* e ada keke vovo ananuwanuwa koyodi wana gugaiyedi.  
\v 17 Faina gavana Aluwaluwa Tabuna nuwanuwana ani taudeyavo yada nuwanuwa gaga keke nuwanuwana.\x † \xo 5:17 \xt Lom 7:23, 8:5-7\x* Ada gavana taudeyavo yada nuwanuwa gaga nuwanuwana ani Aluwaluwa Tabuna keke nuwanuwana. Taidei adiselu tova moyaina ivenibaina ke ivesitaitaina, e ada gavana nuwanuwami ani keke wana gugaiye.\x † \xo 5:17 \xt Lom 7:15,18-19\x*  
\v 18 Aku kai Aluwaluwa Tabuna gina nagonagoyemi,\x † \xo 5:18 \xt Lom 6:14, 8:14\x* keke Mosese yana veimeya dibune wana miyami ke yawai gina veiveimeye.\x † \xo 5:18 \xt Lom 7:4\x*   
\p
\v 19 E ada, dewa koyodi iyegeyegemona tova-nai kaliva taudiyavo yadi nuwanuwa gagana wagaidiya itunutunuvala ani kaalamanedi. Anafaiweya kaliva vovodi iawaawaege-kavokavovodi, inuwanuwa bwanebwanenena, igadawedawelo,  
\v 20 ioduodu yaubada fwayafwaya wagaidiya, ivebalaubalauma, iagoagouga, ivevonavona ke ikikivenuwakoyo, iluluvadiga, inunuwakoyo lakaina, iamaumaula, igavekwavekwageya ke imiyamiyadaka,\x † \xo 5:20 \xt 1Kol 11:19\x*  
\v 21 ada iyuga kwavakwava, isedasedada, ada mali dewa anafaiweya. Ada kaduwe kaliva yadi giba o kai adiivi iitaitaluvadigedi e ada iagouga faidiya. Tuwaina gavonemi anafaiweya, malinai gavonevonemi, badiyavo gavega idewadewa anafaiweya ani keke Yaubada yana ebaveimeya ina nuwaga.   
\p
\v 22-23 Aku Aluwaluwa Tabuna guwana kaliva wagaidiya ani taidei anafaiweya.\x † \xo 5:22-23 \xt Lom 7:4, 8:5, Efes 5:9\x* Kaliva ivenuwanuwakabubu, ivemwamwala, inuwaniwalova, iatuvefaila, inuwakalikali, idewadewa iwakana, idewadewa bikana, ada taudiyavo iawaawatadi. Ada kaduwe tova moyaina idibudibumwaiga e ada wa adivetumagana yadi yauvivila moyaidi wagaidiya.\x † \xo 5:22-23 \xt Mad 7:16-20\x* Taidei dewa-dina faidiya ani keke tamo veimeya gida miyami ayo gida awatadi.  
\v 24 Ada badiyavo gavega Yeisu Keliso yana yoo ani bademowa ikivebolagalagana vovo ananuwanuwa koyona ada nuwanuwa luluvadigadi nodi.\x † \xo 5:24 \xt Kol 3:5\x*  
\v 25 Yawai evaguna ani kamiyamiyanena Aluwaluwa Tabuna wagaine. Tainei faina gilubodana bonana kana abiabina ke Aluwaluwa Tabuna gina nagonagoyeda.  
\v 26 Keke kana nuwalaka e ada tubuiyadeyavo kana kivenuwakoyodi, ada keke kana veitaveluveya ke gaito anayegana lakaina kana agouge.\x † \xo 5:26 \xt Fip 2:3\x*   
\c 6  
\s1 Imi seyana seyana wana velemalema amivita wagaidiya.  
\p
\v 1 Tubuiyakuweyavo, kai gaito wagaimiya dewa koyona gifaifaisewana ada wana itanuwagana, aga imi gavega Aluwaluwa Tabuna ginagonagoyemi ani wananau nuwabikeya wana kivetunutunugina ke wana yewena wai tunutunugina wagaine.\x † \xo 6:1 \xt Sam 141:5, Mad 18:15, 2Kol 2:7, Ibel 12:13, Iyem 5:19\x* Aku wana itaveyabimi aenanai taumiyavo kaduwe aladibidibi wana nuwagana.  
\v 2 Seyana seyana anavita wagaine wana velemalema,\x † \xo 6:2 \xt Lom 15:1-2, 1Tes 5:14\x* ada taidei wagaine imi velemoena Keliso yana veimeya wamatawalewaleyena.\x † \xo 6:2 \xt 1Iyo 4:21, Iyo 13:34\x*  
\v 3 Kai unuwanuwa vaita ayegana lakaina faina, keke alauboda kaliva wa anavita unaleme, aga ina tauni ufwayanegenegeni. Velemoena oye kaliva-kavokavovo.  
\v 4 Aku kaliva seyana seyana tauna yana gugai gida itavenuvenuwadadanena.\x † \xo 6:4 \xt 2Kol 13:5\x* Ada kai yana gugai iwakana, aga gina vemwamwala gavana gigana faina. Aku keke gina itaveluveye mali kaliva yana gugai wagaine,  
\v 5 faina gilubodana seyana seyana tauna onana gina waina.\x † \xo 6:5 \xt Lom 14:12\x*   
\p
\v 6 Badi gavega Yaubada yana vona anavewala ivaivaina, ani gilubodadi yadi gaitoma iwakadi tufodi ina avetavetala yadi tovewala-dina wagaidiya.\x † \xo 6:6 \xt 1Kol 9:11,14\x*  
\v 7 Keke uda nuwanuwa vaita oye ani nuwanuwauya ayo Yaubada, e ada afaiweya unasei vaita Banae wa anaawaveleiga. Keke meyameyaganina. Faina gavana kaliva gina bakulina tauna yawaina wagaine, kaduwe anafaiweya guwana gina yalana.  
\v 8 Kai badi gavega ina bakula vovo ananuwanuwa koyona,\x † \xo 6:8 \xt Iyob 4:8\x* aga guwana ina yalana ani miya luyaweyawela. Aku kai badi gavega ina bakula Aluwaluwa Tabuna yana nuwanuwa anafaiweya, aimo guwana Aluwaluwa Tabuna wagaine-deya ina yalana ani yawai-vagata.\x † \xo 6:8 \xt Iyo 6:63, Lom 8:13\x*  
\v 9 Ada keke kana kabekabebe gugai iwakana wagaidiya,\x † \xo 6:9 \xt 2Tes 3:13\x* faina kai kana atuvefaila-mowa, aimo guwa iwakana kana yalana anatova velemoena wagaine.\x † \xo 6:9 \xt 1Kol 15:18\x*  
\v 10 E ada tova-nai seyana gaito kana itana analauboda lema gida nuwagana, aga kana madulemena. Aku velemoena kana gugai iwakana badi tovetumagana gabuyavo wagaidiya.   
\s1 Paulo yana matawa anaebalauyabu ke vetalakafoi.  
\p
\v 11 Malinai tauku nimakuya vona anaebalauyabu gana vetokilumina, ada wana itana ani matana lakaina.\f ** \fr 6:11 \ft Paulo tubuiyana taidei leta-nai givetokilumina bana faine, aku anaebalauyabu wagaine Paulo feni givaina ada yana vetalakafoi givetokilumina e ada toveyawa ina alamanena banae tauna giimilina.\f*   
\p
\v 12 Kaliva-dina iluluyalimi ke vovo anatomogolota wana vaina, taidei anafaiweya igugai e ada vaita meIsileli ina vemwamwala faidiya. Yadi vuvu velemoena ani imatauta aenanai kai Keliso anakelose faine ina mididi toyogina, aga uloulolo ina nuwanuwagana badi gavega keke Keliso ida vetumagane wagaidiya.\x † \xo 6:12 \xt Gal 5:11\x*  
\v 13 Faina biyavo-dina vovo anatomogolota ivaina nonogana taudiyavo keke Yaubada yana veimeya ida matawalewaleye. Aku nuwanuwadi imi tomogolota wana vaina e ada badi ina gakaikai vaita badi iveimeyemi ada wagugai anafaiweya.  
\v 14 Aku Iyayeku ani keke tamo gavana faina gana gakaikai, aku tainei-mowa yada Kauveya Yeisu Keliso yana alika kelose wagaine faina.\fig Yada Kauveya Yeisu Keliso yana alika kelose wagaine faine Paulo gigakaikai.|src="WA04011b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade" ref="6:14" \fig* Banae yana alika wagaine babi ananuwanuwa vaita gialika wagaikuya, ada Iya anafaiweya vaita gaalika babi ananuwanuwa wagaine.\f ** \fr 6:14 \ft ‘Babi ananuwanuwa’ ani gaitoma moyaina babi wagaidiya ada kaliva taudiyavo yadi kaiwabu ilelelena ke adiyegana ina kilakaina. Gaitoma-dina ivenibaina kelose yana wai wagaine. (Iyem 4:4, 1Iyo 2:15, Gal 2:20-21) \f*  
\v 15 Faina kai vovo anatomogolota kavaina o kai keke, aga tainei gaitoma-kavokavovo. Aku gaitoma lakaina ani Yeisu yawaine katubuga evaguda e ada ideyavo ibuibubuna evagudeyavo.\x † \xo 6:15 \xt 2Kol 5:17\x*  
\v 16 Badi gavega wai-nai imulimuliyena ani Yaubada gina veledi nuwaniwalova ke gina nuwakalikaliyedi. Badiyavo meIsileli velemoena.   
\p
\v 17 Yaku vona anaebalauyabu aku vona seya-moena. Iya vovokuya bwaya imiyamiya ani ganuwagadi Yeisu anayegana faina.\x † \xo 6:17 \xt 2Kol 4:7-11\x* Taidei faina tova taidei ke gina naunau, keke nuwanuwaku gaito seyana kaduwe vita gina kiveyegemoni wagaikuya.   
\p
\v 18 Tubuiyakuweyavo, gaveola yada Kauveya Yeisu Keliso yana nuwadogeya gina lemelememi ke aluwaluwamiya wana lulutovonina. Ika anafaiweya.  
\cls Iyayeku Paulo   